**Corner Smoothing Rule**

Every card, modal, button, CTA, input, dropdown, pill, panel, tooltip, popover, and interactive surface must use **smooth Figma-style corners**, not basic/default browser rounding.

Requirements:
- Use the same corner-smoothing approach already approved in this project.
- Do not use harsh/default `border-radius` alone where the component supports smoother treatment.
- Maintain consistent visual softness across cards and nested controls.
- Inner buttons/CTAs inside rounded cards must also follow the same smoothing language.
- New components must inherit this rule by default.
- Existing components should be updated when touched.
- Do not change component size, spacing, color, or layout just to apply smoothing.
